<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37189" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέρομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερ-είρομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ερήσομαι</span>: aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηρόμην,</span>
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ερέσθαι</span>: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> c. acc. rei, <i>inquire into</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς ἐξείρετο βουλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.127
				</span></i>
			; so also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναξίου μὲν φωτὸς
				ἐξερήσομαι . . τί νῦν κυρεῖ</span>
			<i>will inquire concerning</i> him, what he is now about, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				439
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>inquire of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζῆν᾽ ὕπατον . . ἐξείρετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.756
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ τοὐπίτριπτον κίναδος ἐξήρου μ᾽
					ὅπου;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					103
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ προσέειπε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.361
				</span></i>
			.—
				Ion.
			
			pres.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξείρομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.19
				</span></i>
			: in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> more freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερέω, ἐξερεείνω,
				ἐξερέομαι.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
